# Regenerable measurement evidence (benchmark/comparison outputs).
# Reproduce locally via scripts/benchmark-http.mjs,
# scripts/benchmark-live-sse.mjs, scripts/comparison/run.py, and the
# read-view matrix (`cargo test read_view_performance_matrix --ignored`).
# Host-specific snapshots, never sources: keep them out of version control.
# `scripts/package-dist.sh` still requires them at pack time — generate
# first, then pack.
docs/*benchmark*.json
docs/comparison-results.json
docs/dify-comparison-results.json
docs/performance-environment.json

/.mizu/
